      "statement": "The Payment model requires orderId as 1-128 characters, amountCents as a strict integer >0 and ≤100,000,000, currency as literal 'USD' defaulting to 'USD', and scenario as literal 'success'|'decline'|'timeout' defaulting to 'success'.",
