    {
      "id": "claim_32860190536744dcbe0e60689fe2007f",
      "statement": "On POST /api/payments, the service forwards to provider POST /payments with Idempotency-Key equal to orderId; on refund, it forwards to POST /refunds with body {paymentId, orderId} and Idempotency-Key refund:<orderId>:<paymentId>.",
